    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "These three discovery interfaces are built on three contrasting technologies, come from three different traditions, generate three different sets of expectations. Are they simply three alternative facets on a similar pool of data or are they truly three distinct “personalities”? Using the Three Faces of Eve as a departure point, this presentation will explore the issues that make these powerful discovery tools unique.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
